        "Application Area：",
        "Suitable for separation of metallic ores, such as tungsten‑bearing and gold‑bearing placer ores, tin ore cleaning, etc. It can be used for both fine‑grained and coarse‑grained materials. The maximum feed particle size is 6‑8 mm, while in individual cases of placer ore separation, the maximum size can reach 12 mm.",
