      ],
      [
        "Performance Features",
        "1. Adopts multi‑chamber shared CNC air valve technology.\n2. Equipped with conical slide valve for reliable operation. Fault rate is reduced by 70%, energy consumption is low. It can meet the separation requirements of different media and increase processing capacity by more than 20%.\n3. More rational structure, convenient for transportation and installation. Equipment load is reduced by 30%.\n4. Power consumption is reduced by more than 70%.",
